vot sõnudis.

121
00:12:46.179 --> 00:12:50.140
Jätkage jälitamist.

122
00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.160
Kipennossov,

123
00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:56.679
Kipennossov, Kipennossov, hallo.

124
00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:00.320
Kukekeelega tulnud.

125
00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.670
Ma lähen kinni. Kui

126
00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:07.530
